   "title": "Inflammatory back pain or lower-limb oligoarthritis, rheumatoid factor NEGATIVE: which spondyloarthritis (SpA)?",
   "lines": [
    "shared: sacroiliitis · enthesitis · dactylitis · anterior uveitis · HLA-B27 · raised sedimentation rate and C-reactive protein · good response to anti-inflammatories (NSAIDs)"
   ]
